    "created_at": "2016-01-01T11:14:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-01T11:14:32Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure I understand what you mean. What needs to change is that in the definition of \"fully active\" we first need to check that the document in question has a browsing context and that if it does, it is the active document of that browsing context (plus the remainder of the existing definition).\n",
